<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka stock market closed for Buddhist holiday.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka stock market closed for Buddhist holiday.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's stock market was closed on Thursday to mark a Buddhist holy day.</p>
<p>The market will reopen on Friday.</p>
<p>The Colombo Stock Exchange all share index closed 1.5 points up at 630.4 on Wednesday, but turnover was held down at 32.4 million rupees due to low liquidity and lack of sellers, brokers said.</p>
</text>
